data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Mark each ranked position as a hit or a miss. Precision at k divides the hits in the top k by k. Recall\ndivides them by the number of distinct relevant ids. Reciprocal rank uses the first hit in the whole\nlist. For average precision, walk the top k, and at each hit add the running precision (hits so far over\nthe position). Divide the sum by min(k, number of relevant ids)."},"hints_note":null}

